**Instructions:**
- Take metformin 500 mg orally twice daily.
- Continue metoprolol 25 mg twice daily.
- Continue protonix 40 mg once daily.
- Monitor blood sugar levels regularly.
- Follow up in 2 weeks for reevaluation.
- Schedule an appointment with Dr. Emily Chen for further management.
- Avoid sugary foods and increase physical activity. }}<|eot_id|>
